    {
      "id": "claim_98bb7c5817bf463f9268adc72652a1fb",
      "statement": "convert-roms no longer probes any tool: format_available is a static membership test over the built-in destination formats (7Z, CHD, CSO, NSZ, ORIGINAL, RVZ, ZIP, ZSO) checked once per command and once per system, returning Ok(()) for anything else; export-roms likewise only validates the format string against a static list and bails \"Not supported\"; check-roms performs no availability check at all and re-hashes CHDs in process.",
