      "id": "claim_104cc73b81704ef3a56a511482cf3167",
      "statement": "info.rs (Dependencies section), query.rs (GraphQL dependencies) and mcp/read.rs (build_status, shared by the status tool and the oxyromon://status resource) each call every module's get_version() at request time with no cache, rendering Ok as the version and Err as \"not found\"/null. The list is sevenz-rust2, chd-rs, ctrtool, nod, nsz-rs, xps-rs, xso-rs, xdelta-rs, and only ctrtool can come back missing: the in-process backends return the literal \"built-in\", with nsz appending \", prod.keys not found\".",
