      "id": "claim_48b10727a83d42fa96168f6e34f4f2cc",
      "statement": "There is no setting that names a tool path or overrides ${PATH}: the only remaining executable name is the compile-time constant `const CTRTOOL: &str = \"ctrtool\";`. Per-system CHD_CD/DVD/HD/LD_COMPRESSION_ALGORITHMS, *_HUNK_SIZE (validated against CHD_HUNK_SIZE_RANGE 16..1048576) and CHD_PARENTS still exist and are still read per system by convert_roms/export_roms, but they are now plain parameters handed to src/chd.rs and the chd-rs crate rather than argv for a chdman child process.",
