    {
      "id": "claim_4669a970c9e94f0ea4f9e2f7d3fd80f6",
      "statement": "CI's single dependency step runs apt-get update with retries and installs mame-tools, xdelta3 and ffmpeg, and none of the three is a runtime dependency: the workflow comment states all three exist only so the format crates' tests can compare against chdman and xdelta3 and build LaserDisc AVIs with ffmpeg, and those tests skip when the binary is absent. Nothing installs ctrtool, so CIA import degrades with a printed error on the runner.",
