      "id": "claim_b6c83c1a12b641cfa6bcf72a8d03dd7f",
      "statement": "Tests that need an external reference skip rather than fail: src/import_roms/test_cia.rs returns early on ctrtool::get_version().is_err() (ctrtool is never installed in CI, so the one remaining subprocess path is untested on the runner), crates/chd-rs/tests/write.rs resolves chdman through $CHDMAN then $PATH and returns early when neither yields a file, and its LaserDisc suite additionally requires ffmpeg ($FFMPEG) before generating AVI fixtures.",
